stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED
    CREATED --> UNDERSTANDING: request accepted
    UNDERSTANDING --> PLANNING: intent and constraints resolved
    PLANNING --> PREFLIGHT: plan and criteria created
    PREFLIGHT --> WAITING_APPROVAL: high-risk action detected
    PREFLIGHT --> RUNNING: no approval required
    WAITING_APPROVAL --> RUNNING: user approves
    WAITING_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED: user rejects or timeout
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: execute next step
    RUNNING --> PAUSED: user/system pause
    PAUSED --> RUNNING: resume from checkpoint
    RUNNING --> RECOVERING: crash, timeout, or watchdog intervention
    RECOVERING --> PAUSED: checkpoint available
    RECOVERING --> FAILED: no safe checkpoint or recovery exhausted
    RUNNING --> VERIFYING: candidate result produced
    VERIFYING --> VERIFIED: post-conditions and evidence pass
    VERIFYING --> RECOVERING: verification failure with retry path
    VERIFYING --> PARTIAL: some criteria met, remainder unresolved
    RUNNING --> FAILED: unrecoverable execution error
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: cancellation requested
    VERIFIED --> COMPLETED: final response persisted
    PARTIAL --> COMPLETED: partial result explicitly reported
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]

    note right of PREFLIGHT
      TaskStateManager persists
      immutable goal, criteria,
      actions, approvals, and
      checkpoint metadata.
    end note

    note right of VERIFYING
      Evidence is retained with
      task events and artifacts;
      success is not inferred from
      model text alone.
    end note
